/COM, Done Import Washer FE Data
/COM, Copy Washer to all CS given by ACT object
CompName =strcat(PartNameInAssembly,'_')        !PartNameInAssembly given by ACT to determine if Bolt or Nut Washer.
!use the macro to copy and move each part.

!These check values are standard names from the ACT
!Determine what offset to use for what washer location this is.
*IF,PartNameInAssembly,EQ,'BoltWasher',THEN
  Z_Offset = _BoltZLoc
*ELSE
  Z_Offset = _NutWasherZLoc
*ENDIF

!Copy and move the part
*USE,MoveAndCopyElements.mac,CompName,Z_Offset,_MechElemId
ALLSEL,ALL,ALL